<title>UK: BayerHypo sets 1.0 billion Czech crown 1-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo sets 1.0 billion Czech crown 1-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Creditanstalt Bankverein and Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    19.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  ONE	 REOFFER    100.05    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 25-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
